docs {
  Server sends RST_STREAM(NO_ERROR) right away. **Expected:** a clear error (e.g. "stream reset by server (NO_ERROR)") well within the 5 s timeout. **Bug:** hangs in the app; in the CLI the process exits 0 here.
  
  > **Outcome case.** This request may fail *by design*. Its result is recorded in the runtime var `outcome` and asserted by the next request, **↳ verify: RST_STREAM NO_ERROR before headers**. Run both together (the folder runner does this).
}
